    "## still-klein9b-fal\n\nStill from a reference image (Flux.2 Klein 9B on fal). Needs FAL_KEY and the ComfyUI-fal-API nodes.\n\nFor H3 clips on fal, make stills 1664x960 (16:9-ish) or 960x1664: fal's 480P video is 832x480 and crops anything else.\n\nInputs in CAPITALS are the ones scripts/run_workflow.py sets."
